From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:21:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 10: timeline with day headers, pinch-to-zoom columns
 and fast scroller

- Domain: TimelineSection + TimelineGrouper (per-day sections from DATE_ADDED), observe use case
- Data: loadDatesAdded query, repository flow that refreshes on MediaStore changes
- Presentation: day headers (Today/Yesterday/date), pinch to change 2-6 columns,
  Samsung-style fast scroller with month bubble, video duration badge
- Remove debug labels
- Unit tests for grouping and grid index mapping
